# F-115 — LSRM raw spectra: local-only working copy across ALL detector stations.
# Visual templates built from these are anonymised (path → basename,
# cert-S/N stripped) before commit. Raw .spe / passports stay on
# operator machine, never in git. See detectors/Gamma-1C/README.md §7.
# NOTE: Canonical detector folder = Gamma-1C (НЕ Gamma-1S).
# Гамма-1с (кириллица) ≡ Gamma-1C (латиница омоглиф). User lock 2026-06-05.
# Broadened 2026-06-06: covers all 11 detector raw_lsrm/ slots (multi-detector
# LSRM-tree ingest — F-070 W4 + multi-station scope). Per-detector slots are
# created lazily by distribute_lsrm_tree.py when source files exist.
detectors/*/raw_lsrm/

# Multi-detector LSRM staging area (root-level inbox). Operator copies
# whole LSRM Work/ tree here; orchestrator classifies by folder source-pin
# (README §9 crystal-class map) and distributes into detectors/<NAME>/raw_lsrm/Work/.
# Gitignored: staging is transient, never committed. Removed post-distribution.
_inbox_raw_lsrm/

# Local-only working copies (operator machine, never in git).
# Versioned skill source lives in-repo under scripts/; these are offline snapshots.
archive/
_archive/
books_library-gamma-books_v2026-05-30/
gamma-spectrum-analysis 1.7.7/
gamma-spectrum-analysis_1.17.5/
gamma-spectrum-analysis_1.17.18/
gamma-spectrum-analysis_1.18.21/

claude-skills/

# External Sandia tools downloaded for oracle/probe work (Cambio CLI etc.).
# 3rd-party binaries from GitHub releases — re-downloadable, not project source.
# Drop scripts that need them under audit/_drafts/ with a 1-liner gh release download.
audit/_tools/

# RAG-индексы: построены по книжному корпусу третьих лиц (963 из 1116 docs —
# дословные чанки). Локально нужны для rag_search, в публичный репозиторий НИКОГДА.
references/knowledge_bm25.json
references/knowledge_corpus.json
references/knowledge_index.json

# Gamma-1S: массовая выгрузка рабочего дерева ЛСРМ остаётся локальной.
# В git публикуются только курированные наборы reference_kits/ и
# reference_kits_becqmoni/ — пары «образец + фон» с описью и паспортными
# активностями. Полное дерево пересобирается lsrm_tree_publish.py.
detectors/Gamma-1S/reference_spectra/lsrm/
detectors/Gamma-1S/reference_spectra/becqmoni/
